    },
    "onboarding.privacy.sync.body" : {
      "comment" : "首次引导本地承诺第二条的说明。只能写传输加密：隐私政策写明云端没有端到端加密，不能写成加密存储。",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloud sync is off by default, and signing in uploads nothing. If you turn it on, data is encrypted in transit and used only for sync. Turn it off or delete your cloud data anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "云同步默认关闭，登录也不会自动上传。开启后全程加密传输，只用于同步，随时可以关掉、删除云端数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "雲端同步預設關閉，登入也不會自動上傳。開啟後全程加密傳輸，只用於同步，隨時可以關掉、刪除雲端資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sync.privacy.footer" : {
      "comment" : "「我的 → 云端同步」开关下方的说明，与隐私政策的云同步一节一致；只写传输加密，不写加密存储。",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your ledger travels to Yado's servers over an encrypted connection and is used only to sync between your devices, never analyzed or used for anything else. With sync off, everything on this phone keeps working."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "账本经加密连接传到芽豆的服务器，只用于在你的设备之间同步，不做分析，也不用于其他目的。关闭同步后，本机数据照常可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "帳本經加密連線傳到芽豆的伺服器，只用於在你的裝置之間同步，不做分析，也不用於其他目的。關閉同步後，本機資料照常可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
